\title{Optimal Non-Adaptive Group Testing \\ with One-Sided Error Guarantees}

\author{{Daniel McMorrow} and
{Jonathan Scarlett}\thanks{The authors are with the  Department of Computer Science, School of Computing, National University of Singapore (NUS). J.~Scarlett is also with the Department of Mathematics, NUS, and the Institute of Data  Science, NUS. Emails: \url{mcmorrow@nus.edu.sg};  \url{scarlett@comp.nus.edu.sg}}
