For Lemma \ref{lem5}, we will ultimately use the same ``dummy non-defectives'' idea as that of Lemma \ref{lem4}, but before doing so, we need to transfer a result from \cite{bay2022optimal} from \emph{number of masked items} to \emph{number of masked defectives}.  

