 This proves the claim.
\end{proof}
}

We have that the original instance $(\Xcal=(X,\dist),\woutl,\wmod,W,\koutl,\kmod,d)$ and the obtained instance $(\Xcal'=(X',\dist),\woutl,\wmod,W,\koutl,\kmod,d)$ of \WEEO are equivalent. We prove that $|X'|=\Oh(k^2d^2)$. 

\begin{claim}\deferProof{}\label{cl:size}
$|X'|\leq 9(\koutl+\kmod)^2(d+3)^2$.
\end{claim}

