We provide a \proglang{Python} package (\pkg{masspcf}) and accompanying \proglang{C++} library for performing massively parallel computations with piecewise constant functions (PCFs) at machine precision. In rough terms, a PCF is a 1-D function that changes at only a finite number of points. Such functions are abundant in statistics and data science, as well as more broadly within science and engineering.

