\subsection{Contrastive Learning for Detecting Anomalies in Unlabeled Energy Consumption Time Series}

%% Nazim: the link between this section and the previous is not obvious. Here the subject is anomalie detection but it was not introduced before. Need to make a link between ML agent and CL for anomaly detection and how this information is used by SRO and NRO. Also it should be explained how the dataset is built. What are the anomalies and how they impact the system.  

